# Rust conventions

- Workspace crates: `shardman-core`, `shardman-server`, `shardman-agent`, `shardman-cli`.
- Domain types / `period_id` / FSM live in **shardman-core**; no axum/sqlx in core.
- Prefer `Result` in libraries; `unwrap`/`expect` only in tests or proven-infallible sites.
- HTTP: axum; DB: sqlx + SQL migrations under `migrations/`.
- Config from env (LBF-style): `CLUSTER_KEY`, `METADATA_PG_DSN`, `SEAL_CHECK_INTERVAL`, etc.
- Never log full DSNs with passwords.
- Unit-test `period_id` and FSM in core; integration tests hit real metadata Postgres.
